  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communicating with impact: training for EU Delegations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Training for EU Delegations designed to ensure staff have the skills and expertise required to manage professional communication campaigns implemented by specialised external agencies. This includes the provision of both online learning as well as in-person workshops and seminars, facilitated and delivered by external experts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
